    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/d065c8d801452f0b357fb02a26b24b84.avif?t=1738767781\" width=600 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/ef4008b9ebaca73b27ba75abbf487698.poster.avif?t=1738767781\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/ef4008b9ebaca73b27ba75abbf487698.webm?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/ef4008b9ebaca73b27ba75abbf487698.mp4?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah, capitalism, the marvel of our times! Imagine a world where the pursuit of profit reigns supreme, where the sweet aroma of competition fills the air like the scent of freshly printed money. Picture a utopia where every dollar earned is a badge of honor, and the winners of this grand economic game bask in the glow of excess while others marvel at the overflowing abundance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the magical kingdom of CapitalismCraft, you get to experience this paradise first hand! Play as a savvy entrepreneur and use your business-acumen to hire lowly desk workers to make you tons and tons of money! Your workers may get demoralized over time, but hey, that's just the reality of the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to maximize profits? Fire your workers before payday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to sit back and enjoy some passive income? Hire a Middle Manager to do your job for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers getting harassed by management? Hire an HR person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, come join the party! Revel in the glory of CapitalismCraft, where the pursuit of profit is the noblest of endeavors, and inequality is just a side effect of the grand symphony of the free market. Because in this land of plenty, there's always room for more (although more for some than others)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/4a99b4c3912b55fd3e44d6d8f9c18d4d.avif?t=1738767781\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/1c0abe3b76c6106ec9a0a5d79d05fa0b.poster.avif?t=1738767781\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/1c0abe3b76c6106ec9a0a5d79d05fa0b.webm?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/1c0abe3b76c6106ec9a0a5d79d05fa0b.mp4?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a business simulation from the eagle-eyed perspective of a CEO!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit your cute animal workers to make lots and lots of money, managing their efficiency and demoralization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit managers to whip your employees into action whenever they dare to take a break!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire specialists to keep them working when the management pushes them past their breaking point!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire and hire at a whim to pad your bottom line!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the unreasonable demands of shareholders getting in the line of your profits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the even less reasonable demands of unions (fair wages, really?) before they get out of hand and infect your whole workforce with silly ideas like labor rights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your fledgling company into an apex predator of the free market, a capitalist utopia where you and your shareholders make a ton of money and everyone else none at all!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/70ea9ece30b6b294f89c7f2f1787adf4.poster.avif?t=1738767781\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/70ea9ece30b6b294f89c7f2f1787adf4.webm?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/70ea9ece30b6b294f89c7f2f1787adf4.mp4?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/d065c8d801452f0b357fb02a26b24b84.avif?t=1738767781\" width=600 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/ef4008b9ebaca73b27ba75abbf487698.poster.avif?t=1738767781\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/ef4008b9ebaca73b27ba75abbf487698.webm?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/ef4008b9ebaca73b27ba75abbf487698.mp4?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah, capitalism, the marvel of our times! Imagine a world where the pursuit of profit reigns supreme, where the sweet aroma of competition fills the air like the scent of freshly printed money. Picture a utopia where every dollar earned is a badge of honor, and the winners of this grand economic game bask in the glow of excess while others marvel at the overflowing abundance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the magical kingdom of CapitalismCraft, you get to experience this paradise first hand! Play as a savvy entrepreneur and use your business-acumen to hire lowly desk workers to make you tons and tons of money! Your workers may get demoralized over time, but hey, that's just the reality of the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to maximize profits? Fire your workers before payday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to sit back and enjoy some passive income? Hire a Middle Manager to do your job for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers getting harassed by management? Hire an HR person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, come join the party! Revel in the glory of CapitalismCraft, where the pursuit of profit is the noblest of endeavors, and inequality is just a side effect of the grand symphony of the free market. Because in this land of plenty, there's always room for more (although more for some than others)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/4a99b4c3912b55fd3e44d6d8f9c18d4d.avif?t=1738767781\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/1c0abe3b76c6106ec9a0a5d79d05fa0b.poster.avif?t=1738767781\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/1c0abe3b76c6106ec9a0a5d79d05fa0b.webm?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/1c0abe3b76c6106ec9a0a5d79d05fa0b.mp4?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a business simulation from the eagle-eyed perspective of a CEO!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit your cute animal workers to make lots and lots of money, managing their efficiency and demoralization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit managers to whip your employees into action whenever they dare to take a break!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire specialists to keep them working when the management pushes them past their breaking point!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire and hire at a whim to pad your bottom line!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the unreasonable demands of shareholders getting in the line of your profits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the even less reasonable demands of unions (fair wages, really?) before they get out of hand and infect your whole workforce with silly ideas like labor rights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your fledgling company into an apex predator of the free market, a capitalist utopia where you and your shareholders make a ton of money and everyone else none at all!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/70ea9ece30b6b294f89c7f2f1787adf4.poster.avif?t=1738767781\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/70ea9ece30b6b294f89c7f2f1787adf4.webm?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742930/extras/70ea9ece30b6b294f89c7f2f1787adf4.mp4?t=1738767781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the wonderful world of capitalism! Exploit your workers to earn money! Hire managers to crush their spirits and drive them harder, then fire them once you\u2019ve achieved your ends! Be agile, ruthless, merciless, become the richest CEO in the world, winning in rapid clicker management!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cCapitalismCraft is a clicker game that not only offers entertainment but also inserts sharp social criticism against the reality of the working world and the capitalist system.\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 Honest Gaming Review<br>",
